kind: profile
question: does shared BF16 tensor-core prompt GEMM reduce 4K prefill latency on GB10?
term: prefill tokens per second for one 4096-id code-fn request per arm
unit: %
predict: +50..+200
condition: load baseline once and candidate once on the same otherwise idle
  GPU and timing lease. Use identical stored weights and prompt ids, C=1,
  draft off and two generated tokens. Run each request once, without rounds.
  Check distinct binary hashes and zero cached prompt tokens. Restore the
  host clock limit on every exit and yield to waiting PR checks.
decide-in: report the observed ratio with the actual one-request sample counts.
decide-below: report the measured difference without adding repetitions.
decide-above: inspect input length, cache hits and binary provenance before reporting.
